    "$comment": "SynthWave '84 palette for gen-primer-theme. Source: https://github.com/robb0wen/synthwave-vscode themes/synthwave-color-theme.json (MIT) — editor.background #262335, sideBar/statusBar #241b2f, input/badge #2a2139, editorWidget #171520, dropdown #232530, hover #37294d, button #614d85, foreground #ffffff, comment #848bbd, muted text #b6b1b1, pink #ff7edb, textLink/cursor #f97e72, orange #ff8b39, yellow #fede5d, green #72f1b8, cyan #36f9f6, blue #2ee2fa / #03edf9, purple #b893ce, red #fe4450. Base: @primer/primitives dark. Canvas editor bg, inset sidebar bg, raised input bg, borders derived (#37294d hover, #4a3d6b), text white / muted comment #848bbd (4.7:1), disabled derived #6b6f9c. Accent + primary button pink (dark text), link the theme's own textLink #f97e72, success green, danger red (4.5:1 on canvas, text lifted to #fb6567), attention yellow, severe orange, done purple, sponsors pink. The neon text glow of the original is a CSS effect and is not reproduced in tokens — colours only.",
